  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Beira Land Administration Systems (BLAS) &#x2013; Inception phase 2022-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activities of this project are aimed at strengthening the sustainability of the achieved results of the previous projects activities of both VNG International and Cadastre International for land administration. Cadastre International aims to strengthen all components which are needed to set up a properly functioning cadastral register. The VNG focusses on project management and capacity building of the Municipality of Beira (CMB). The inception phase will deliver a comprehensive support approach for the period 2022-2026. Key elements of support are:1.	Recordation of pilot areas;2.	Digitalisation of cadastre archives and improvement of land administration;3.	Increased performance of the municipal organisation;4.	Improvement of property tax revenues;5.	Follow-up activities from the BLAS project;6.	Broad contributions of focal point for other project managers of activities related to the Beira Master Plan (BMP) 2035.</narrative>
  </description>
